amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.microwaves101.com%2Fencyclopedias%2Frotman-lens&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ARotman+lens\" about=\"#mwt12\" id=\"mwcw\"></span></span></li>\n<li about=\"#cite_note-5\" id=\"cite_note-5\" data-mw-footnote-number=\"5\"><span id=\"mwdA\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-5\" rel=\"mw:referencedBy\" id=\"mwdQ\"><span id=\"mwdg\">↑</span></a></span> <span id=\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-5\"><cite id=\"CITEREFKilicWeiss2010\" about=\"#mwt16\">Kilic, Ozlem; Weiss, Steven J. (June 2010). <a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/7909283\" id=\"mweA\">\"Rotman lens applications for the US Army: A review of history, present, and future\"</a>. <i id=\"mweQ\">URSI Radio Science Bulletin</i>. <b id=\"mweg\">2010</b> (332): <span id=\"mwew\">10–</span>23 <span typeof=\"mw:Entity\" id=\"mwfA\">–</span> via IEEE Explore.</cite><span title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=URSI+Radio+Science+Bulletin&amp;rft.atitle=Rotman+lens+applications+for+the+US+Army%3A+A+review+of+history%2C+present%2C+and+future&amp;rft.volume=2010&amp;rft.issue=332&amp;rft.pages=10-23&amp;rft.date=2010-06&amp;rft.aulast=Kilic&amp;rft.aufirst=Ozlem&amp;rft.au=Weiss%2C+Steven+J.&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fieeexplore.ieee.org%2Fdocument%2F7909283&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ARotman+lens\" about=\"#mwt16\" id=\"mwfQ\"></span></span></li>\n<li about=\"#cite_note-6\" id=\"cite_note-6\" data-mw-footnote-number=\"6\"><span id=\"mwfg\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-6\" rel=\"mw:referencedBy\" id=\"mwfw\"><span id=\"mwgA\">↑</span></a></span> <span id=\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-6\"><cite about=\"#mwt19\" id=\"mwgg\"><a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"https://www.radartutorial.eu/06.antennas/an75.en.html\" id=\"mwgw\">\"Rotman Lens - Radartutorial\"</a>. <i id=\"mwhA\">www.radartutorial.eu</i>. <a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240607134